```
===================================================================
Detection Name: Multi-Stage Cyber Kill Chain Correlation Search
Author: SOC Team
Target Asset: Enterprise Workstations & Servers
Data Sources: 
  - index=wineventlog (Windows Security Event Logs)
  - index=edr_sysmon (Sysmon Process, File, and ProcessAccess Telemetry)
  - index=ids_suricata (Suricata Network Intrusion Detection Alerts)
MITRE ATT&CK: 
  - T1110 (Brute Force / Password Spraying)
  - T1566 (Phishing / Double Extension Execution)
  - T1059 (PowerShell Download Cradle)
  - T1003 (OS Credential Dumping: LSASS Memory)
  - T1071 (Application Layer Protocol: C2 Beaconing)
Severity: Critical
Threshold: Consolidated correlation across 2 or more distinct attack stages
Recommended Action:
  1. Trigger immediate P1 Incident escalation in ServiceNow (INC0010004).
  2. Network isolate affected endpoint (CORP-WORKSTATION01).
  3. Revoke compromised account credentials (CORP\finance_svc).
===================================================================
```
(index=wineventlog EventCode IN (4625, 4624)) OR 
(index=edr_sysmon EventCode IN (1, 10, 11)) OR 
(index=ids_suricata event_type=alert)
| eval Incident_Stage=case(
    EventCode=="4625", "1. Brute Force Attempt (T1110)",
    EventCode=="4624", "2. Successful Authentication",
    (EventCode=="1" OR EventCode=="11") AND (TargetFilename LIKE "%Invoice_Q3%" OR Image LIKE "%Invoice_Q3%"), "3. Spearphishing Attachment Execution (T1566)",
    EventCode=="1" AND (CommandLine LIKE "%powershell%" OR CommandLine LIKE "%Invoke-%"), "4. Suspicious PowerShell Cradle (T1059)",
    EventCode=="10" AND TargetImage LIKE "%lsass.exe", "5. LSASS Credential Dump (T1003)",
    event_type=="alert", "6. Suricata Network IDS C2 Alert (T1071)"
)
| where isnotnull(Incident_Stage)
| table _time, host, Incident_Stage, TargetUserName, Image, CommandLine, TargetFilename, "alert.signature", src_ip, dest_ip
| sort _time
